direction: right
old: Retired competing authority {
  code: Code / initializer / private API\nremoved by 5c0ff489
  table: Residual VM 64-word table\nremoved by this cut
}
actual: Existing actual authority {
  activation: Lifecycle activation\nlogical permission + physical last use
  roots: RC canonical roots\nwrite / borrow / freeze / scan
  activation -> roots: explicit source custody
}
abi: Existing native ABI boundary {
  header: Two canonical templates\n51 generated C inputs unchanged
  make: Original Make phases\nrecompile native objects
  loader: Original module size checks\nold rejects / new runs
  header -> make -> loader
}
proof: Source-bound acceptance {
  sysml: OpenSysML SDK\nobligations / adapters
  ascent: ASCENT\nmissing / stale refuse
  native: Real roots + multi-shot + PBT\nfixed profile and limits
  sysml -> ascent -> native
}
old.table -> abi.header: no replacement table
actual -> abi: source semantics unchanged
abi -> proof.native
open: Separate unresolved scope\ndefault-mode failures / stable speedup\n3 pre-existing CI producer bindings\nindependent SMP stays 1 of 12
proof -> open: explicit non-admission
